{"server":"cn","storyId":"act24side_level_act24side_st02","groupId":"act24side","stageId":"act24side_st02","title":"林昏焰明","storyCode":"CF-ST-2","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act24side/level_act24side_st02.txt","sourceHash":"544dafc80f4028741ce6ac7638097ebc506dd4a0be1cba107e67d49027131f3a","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"暮色将至，迷失方向的一行人跟随神秘线索来到了废弃营地，从中一窥村子的过去。稍作休整后，两位干员从工匠猫手中获得了新装备。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"36_g4_redleafcliff"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"俺又望见那块石头了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多少次了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"俺算算，第七次了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们一直在这里兜圈子，不管往哪个方向前进总是会回到这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果能记录下行动的轨迹......装备里有够长的绳子吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"以后俺会记得申请的......啊对了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"工匠猫......你在干嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工匠猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_751_1","isRemote":false,"text":"挖，挖，挖矿喵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"俺......记得你身上是不是有很多好东西，让俺摸摸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工匠猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_751_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喵——喵喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，呃，这里......啊哈！这个或许可以？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑色的粉末，的确能够作为沿途的标记。你们在这里等着，我去试试。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"夜刀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"俺看见你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用你说，我看见地上的痕迹了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又回来了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先是被莫名其妙的发狂兽群追，又丢了火龙的踪迹，现在被困在走不出去的山崖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"定位设备全部失灵，图像无法显示......这片森林到底有什么毛病？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不行，我再去试试，绝不能就在这里停下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"夜刀......你冷静些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"你听俺说，这可能是某种特殊的自然现象，不是什么威胁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"再等等好吗？观察一下，说不定有什么被俺们漏下的地方，一定会有破解的办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"而且......你有没有觉得俺们身边又少了什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"36_g3_redleafforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜刀——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑角——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小工匠——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们在哪里喵？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，都出来吧，不要再恶作剧了喵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑角，你就在那棵树后面对不对喵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小工匠，别以为你藏在那块石头后面我就发现不了你喵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜刀，快从树上下来喵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有......不在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"完了，这下完了喵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是稍微观察了一会儿树上的奇怪纹路，大家一转眼就不见了喵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"结果那些纹路只是没有价值的树皮破损喵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我的错......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么可能喵？学者认真做观察的时候，跟班们就应该老老实实地在原地等着喵！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都怪他们，没有我的话他们才找不到火龙，谁让他们不好好关注我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在我不见了，他们知道我有多重要了，肯定在急着到处寻找我的踪迹喵，特别是黑角和小工匠这两个笨家伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜刀......她凶巴巴的，但她和我还有约定喵，不可能扔下我不管！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怕、怕什么？我安安心心地在原地等着他们来找我就好了喵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喵！救我喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"森林......森林里有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道我堂堂原书士队的生态学者，未来的泰拉首席专家......我的荣誉猫生就要在这里止步了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能喵！我一定可以——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喵......我再也不掉队了喵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑角，我一定再也不说你笨了。小工匠，我会偶尔表扬你的......啊，会经常，经常表扬的喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喵呜，有人能来救我吗......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"学者猫，你在干嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工匠猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_751_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喵......我......你怎么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑角！你这个愚蠢！迟钝！缓慢的长角怪人喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？俺怎么了？你凭什么这么说俺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这家伙......打扰原王立古生物书士队的优秀学者做生态调查了喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"等......能再说一遍吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻烦两位认清现在的状况，我们在这里被困了超过两个小时。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太阳即将落山，有拌嘴的功夫不如再多找找离开的办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"......学者猫，说！你在研究啥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗷呜！不要你管喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"俺来瞅瞅......夜刀！这树干上刻着字！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"“山崖区域异常记录......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"“参照物不可靠，循风而行。未来”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"应该是过去来到这里的人留下来的，上面的意思是说，要沿着风的方向前进。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喵？那竟然是你们这里的字吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"学者猫，原来你是发现了这个，不错嘛！俺小瞧你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......喵！什么叫小瞧我了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"风吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"用刚才的粉末，从高点的地方撒下来就能看到风的方向了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好主意，我们马上出发。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"俺再瞧两眼，感觉这字不像是过了很长时间的样子......“未来”是什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！等等俺！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"36_g5_redleaflake"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"总算出来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是湖喵，难怪会有吹过来的风。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先别过去，湖岸那边有像是营地一样的布置，无法确定是否有人在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们等着，我去调查......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"营地！篝火！烤肉！出发喵！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工匠猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_751_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喵！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"36_g7_lakecamp"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"欸——哈，火终于点着了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"这片营地被废弃挺久了，应该是过去的猎人留下的，不过东西还算好使。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧，我姑且同意你的提议，夜晚的行动效率不如白天，对火龙踪迹的调查也有所阻碍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暂时休整可以补充体能，但整顿完毕后我们必须尽快出发。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"俺知道啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......哈哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你笑什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，俺......哈，俺就感觉你还和以前一样，总像身后有追兵似的，急着往前赶路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"俺俩都跟着博士干那么久了，博士那临危不乱的功夫，你都没有学到点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士也会希望我们尽快达成任务目标。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"行，行，俺说不过你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"你不如就像以前那样听俺的，闭上眼睛喘口气，到时候上路了神清气爽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"俺呢，就去把这营地捯饬一下，再看看有没有能用上的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"休息......吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"从这里的情况来看，村长在狩猎这件事上是没对俺们说谎。除了柏生家的那位老爷子，现在没人去做猎人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"俺觉得这情况和俺们进的那个大洞穴绝对逃不开关系，说不定柏生家老爷子的坏脾气也是因为......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找到了火龙就能知道一切，有时间推断无意义的事情还不如现在就出发。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"好嘛......呸呸，这箱子上全是灰，锁也锈坏了，俺看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，夜刀你瞧，里面都是猎人过去的装备......砍刀、匕首、组装好的陷阱，还有绳子，相当结实呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有用的都尽量拿上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，这里有一截矛，好像和柏生家老爷子背着的那种矛是同一种类型的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那样的矛我只在这里见过，应该是当地人为方便狩猎制作出来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"俺手上的矛只剩下半截了，箱子里面也没有矛头，你看看呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"咋了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有点惊讶，这柄矛制作的精巧程度出乎我的意料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"矛柄中心被凿穿了，埋进去的这是......弓弦？像是用某种动物的毛编织而成，相当结实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来如此，柄上的开关是控制弓弦的，可以把矛头弹射出去。这弓弦的长度......威力肯定不容小觑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上方断掉的部分是旋轮，根据剩下的构造来看，至少有单向旋转与锁死矛头两个功能，足以应对多种战斗情境了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......设计这柄武器的人是个行家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"武器还是你在行，俺就只能擦擦刀什么的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给你，放回去吧，这我们用不上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"欸——等等，柄上有写了些什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"柏生......柏生明？他是这柄矛的主人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"俺怎么记得老猎人叫柏生义冈，这个名字看起来和他很有关系的样子，俺再找找看还有没有别的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑角，你......嗯？地上这是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？俺来瞅一眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是张相片，估计是你刚才开箱子的时候飘出来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"是在这里拍的猎人合影哇，你看右下角的日期，离现在已经九年了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"右边的那是......是村长吗？那时候他竟然也是猎人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"应该是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"穿上猎人衣服的感觉和现在的感觉完全不一样，他的右手边还站着一个小女孩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，这个人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你别大呼小叫的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"相片中间这个人，只有他背着矛，好像就是那柄断掉的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"柏生明......是他吗？看上去样子很年轻，现在......九年过去了，年纪应该也不到中年吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"但是俺不记得村子里有这个模样的人，夜刀，你有印象吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"这张相片是猎人的合影，柏生老爷子却不在里面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能只是单纯地没有参与拍摄，把相片放回去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"泷居村长当时可真是年轻不少啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是老猎人在那时就与这群猎人有矛盾所以不同行？但是这位同姓柏生的人和村长看起来很亲近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"俺记得村子里确实有猎人的雕像，但似乎已经荒废了。还有村长，他当时明明也是猎人啊？奇怪......也是因为柏生明吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑角！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不用再说了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这种毫无意义的个人背景上浪费精力，相片上多了谁少了谁，柏生家有几个人或是几头驮兽，这对我们的任务有任何帮助吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太多余了，黑角。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是因为你总是为这种事情分心，任务才经常被拉长进度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说到底，就算知道了那个老爷子的家长里短我们又能怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道我们还要花时间给他做心理辅导吗？那要是还有其他人呢？你要对每个人展现出你的博爱吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"村里的那些人......你也见到了他们的状况吧，还有那个孩子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的人什么都不知道，就在一步步地落入深渊。我们能做到的只有去挽救他们的生命，除此之外都无能为力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"越快接触到火龙，我们就越接近与之相关的真相，越有机会尽早遏制矿石病在村庄中恶化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们必须努力......再努力一点，拼尽全力，才能尽快让他们安全，这是我们的责任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑角......干员，你需要对此有清楚的认知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"俺记着的，你别发火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，就是，俺很难不在意柏生家老爷子的状态。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"他说的那些话，他的行为......一样不可理喻的顽固，执着于独自一人面对所有，仿佛为了逃避什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"你忘记了吗？就和那时的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"不，算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"俺不认为他的表现和任务毫无关系，只是现在还没有证据。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那好，黑角干员，我以罗德岛A4行动组组长的身份命令你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在本次任务中，直到证据出现之前，停止对任务目标之外事件的关注。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"俺......收到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"......夜刀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"我也......很担心你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我去周围排除威胁，休息完毕后立刻出发。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"36_g5_redleaflake"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑角这家伙，自己跑去玩篝火，把我赶去钓鱼喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工匠猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_751_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是叫鳞兽喵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你懂什么？根据他们的描述，结合我丰富的知识推断，鳞兽和鱼就是一样的喵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"♪浮标，扔下去，喵喵。漂呀漂，喵喵♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工匠猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_751_1","isRemote":false,"text":"♪敲呀敲，喵喵♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小工匠哟，你还记得我中午说的话吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我翻了翻我记录的泰拉生态笔记，终于知道哪里奇怪了喵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这片森林......没有怪物喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我们的大陆上，环境里肯定少不了超级厉害的怪物的，那些学者怎么说的来着......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，调节，它们是有调节的作用喵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是这里，我们到现在为止，一头这样的生物都没有见过喵，实在太奇怪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有那群横冲直撞的角兽，我看到它们经过的地方，连树皮都被啃干净了喵，这说明什么你知道吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工匠猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_751_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喵喵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小工匠笨，这说明一开始肯定不是这样的，不然那些树都生长不起来喵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这片森林的生态秩序......在过去的某个时间点被打破了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什么......消失了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喵，不用担心，这次有你我的帮助，他们就算弱一点，好好准备也能和火龙比划比划！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，小工匠，你有没有在听我说话喵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工匠猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_751_1","isRemote":false,"text":"♪敲呀敲，喵喵♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，早知道就不让你做这个了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工匠猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_751_1","isRemote":false,"text":"♪敲呀敲，喵喵♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可恶！浮标也一动不动，这要什么时候才能钓上来喵？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"学者猫，鳞兽钓上来了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑角，你来得正好喵，过来坐这里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个给你，拿着喵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"钓竿，给俺干什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保持喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你在干嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看你钓鱼喵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，学者猫，你你你——啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"浮标——浮标沉下去了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"好沉——怎么办啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用力，用力拉喵！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"36_g7_lakecamp"},{"type":"narration","text":"她们死了......因为你......\n不要再逃避了......夜刀......\n因为你......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，哈......怎么会想起......那么久远的事？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"黑角喵！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烤肉转四圈就够了喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"胡说，俺瞧着的，肉都没有变色......哇！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么突然就变色了啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"完了，烤焦了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑角！不听我话！自己吃掉喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"你还怪俺！要不是你和俺说话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喵嗷！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"你干什么？不许抓俺的角啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"俺看你不如把这力气用到对付火龙上，别一遇见就跑得影儿都不见了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是和你们说了喵，有办法对付火龙的，它的弱点我都抄在笔记上了喵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是你们的武器太弱了喵，不过幸好我有先见之明，让小工匠加急去制作更强的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"火龙吗......不知道火龙的肉烤来吃会是什么味道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，我告诉你，火龙的肝才是最了不起的美味！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！谁！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"夜刀！你去哪！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"36_g5_redleaflake"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才那个一闪而过的影子，是往这边跑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么人？出来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（去哪里了？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔喵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（是那边！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我给你个机会，自己现身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（缓缓贴近）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给我出来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工匠猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_751_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喵！夜刀喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"工匠猫？是你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工匠猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_751_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对，不可能是你，刚才那个身影......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不见了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"夜刀——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你一下子跑太快了，俺追了半天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"你是瞧见什么了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，但是跟丢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"工匠猫，你跑到这里干嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工匠猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_751_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喵，素材敲敲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"这些是......防具和武器？给俺们用来打火龙的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工匠猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_751_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别乱碰喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工匠猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_751_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喵，没有石头喵，用这个代替喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"这么随意地替换真的可以吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工匠猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_751_1","isRemote":false,"text":"壳......咔咔，嵌进去喵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工匠猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_751_1","isRemote":false,"text":"完成了！两个人的装备喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"是让我们换上的意思吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工匠猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_751_1","isRemote":false,"text":"穿上！对付火龙更好喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以试试。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"俺马上换上，已经迫不及待了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......黑角，你去那边换。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这个......怎么穿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"手从这里穿进去吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，为什么是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这个款式......我从来没有尝试过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真的可以吗？我不确定......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"36_g5_redleaflake"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好重......面罩好闷，是这样戴的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇啊！好扎手，为什么在这里也有刺？比俺头上的角都要长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"俺非常怀疑......这真的是给人穿的衣服吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（这材质的确非常轻盈，但韧度却是超乎想象的惊人。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（工匠猫说这身防具是用它带来的火龙素材做的，不愧是连夜刀也无法砍碎的材质......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不过......这个地方的材质，摸上去的感觉好熟悉。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（是在哪里遇到过吗？想不起来，到底是哪里呢？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜刀！俺好了，你在哪里哇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"俺来了！哎哟......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"磕到头了，痛......什么都看不清。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是这样戴的吗？终于戴正了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（看向夜刀）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"36_i05"},{"type":"narration","text":"“轻便，迅捷，强大。”\n此后谈论到这身奇异的新装备时，我时常会发出这样的感叹。\n“可是我们感叹的不是这个啊！”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"36_i05"},{"type":"narration","text":"其他干员却总是这么回答。\n他们说的究竟是什么，我现在还是非常不理解。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"36_i05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这套装备......未免也太清凉了，真的能起到防护的作用吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但......皮肤上有奇妙的感觉，麻酥酥的，光照不适感也消失了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工匠猫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"麒麟衍生武具，起作用喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"麒麟衍生武具？是这身装备的名字吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工匠猫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的喵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......看来回去得问问惊蛰了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工匠猫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"泰拉素材！不错喵！很好的替代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工匠猫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）......谢谢源石虫喵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"新的刀刃还需要经过战斗检验......黑角？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么倒在这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳......俺、俺不太适应新装备，摔了一跤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你的面具......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"摘掉了，似乎不再需要面具遮光了，轻便一些也便于行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你......在看什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没什么！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......快点起来，危机随时可能发生，抓紧时间适应。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦！俺明白！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜刀！黑角喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个怪老爷爷......来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他拿了你们的装备喵！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_500_noirc","aliases":["夜刀","黑角"]}]}
